    narr:narration """This position holds that day-old bread markdowns are coordinated as a single two-o'clock move: [the half-price cut happens at two in the afternoon, not at close](narr:Expr_20261009_3_Batch2Bakery20261009050853_hff9ef5f7293e_1), and [the shelf card changes at the same hour so the price is never a surprise at the till](narr:Expr_20261009_3_Batch2Bakery20261009050853_hff9ef5f7293e_2). Both member expressions, voiced the same day, treat timing and signage as one decision rather than separate steps.""" ;
